antibox
=======

A window manager for X11 (xcb)

Features
--------

- Stacking window managment 
- Taskbar 
- Pager with window previews 
- Alt+Tab switching

Building
--------
    cargo build --release

Usage
-----

    antibox [OPTIONS]

Options:

    -h, --help                   print help
    -V, --version                print version


